  m_text: "A flamboyantly dressed traveler lounges by the roadside, a sly grin playing
    across their lips as they shuffle a deck of ornate cards. With a flourish, they
    beckon you closer, their voice smooth as silk. \"Ah, a weary traveller! Care
    for a little game of chance? Win, and your pockets grow heavy with gold. Lose\u2026
    well, fortune favors the bold.\" Your spirit guide shifts uneasily, sensing mischief
    in the air."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e28d09fc135806d4993aec4bfe71107c, type: 2}
